{"schemaVersion":2,"root":{"fen":"rnbakabnr/9/1c5c1/p1p1p1p1p/9/9/P1P1P1P1P/1C5C1/9/RNBAKABNR w - - 0 1","comment":"评注　弈天聚贤阁智弈 \r\n　　重庆洪智(先胜)湖北柳大华 \r\n　　(2007年3月21日弈于淄博) \r\n　　中炮缓开车对左三步虎","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h2e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9g7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g3g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i9h9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0g2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c6c5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0a2","comment":"红不走常见的车一平二而改跳边马有意打破常规。如改走车一平二，黑则马2进3，成为了流行的中炮直车对屏风马的变化。以下红则炮八平七，马3进2，马八进九，卒1进1，车九进一，卒1进1，兵九进一，车1进5，车二进四，象7进5，车九平四，车1平4，车四进三，车4进1，炮七退一，马2进3，车四平八，马3进1，相七进九，炮2平4，马三进四，车4平5，马四进三，士6进5，黑方足可满意。选自本届比赛第2轮胡荣华先和陶汉明的实战对局。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h7i7","comment":"黑方平炮亮车，是求变的下法。柳大华和洪智师徒多年，可以说彼此十分了解，现在平边炮，暗含斗智斗勇的意味。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b2c2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9c7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a0b0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c7d5","comment":"黑方上马正确，如改走车1平2，红则车八进六，黑方局势不利。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0b5","comment":"红方进车显示了洪智积极进取的风格，如改走车八进四，则相对平稳一些。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b7e7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b5c5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d5e3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c5c9","comment":"红方箭在弦上已不得不发，如改走马三进五，炮5进4，仕六进五，象3进5，黑方反先。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a9a8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c2d2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9h5","comment":"黑方含蓄点可走车1平4，仕六进五，马5退7，这样红一路车暂时没通路，黑方较有抗衡的机会。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i0h0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h5h0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g2h0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e3g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d0e1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a8d8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"m